      "content": "that makes sense. i've also heard some stuff about how things like pain management or even how much certain symptoms \"matter\" can differ across groups. like, is there any clinical basis for the idea that different races have different pain tolerances or physical responses to being treated? i just want to make sure i'm not missing anything for the exam.",
